#ASSERT `members the definition of a term names` "s 38" "bail justice" FALSE EQUALS JUST (LIST "a person appointed as a bail justice under section 14 of the Honorary Justices Act 2014", "a person re-appointed as a bail justice under section 15 of the Honorary Justices Act 2014", "a person who is a bail justice by virtue of holding a prescribed office under section 18 of the Honorary Justices Act 2014")
